# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，工作区检出也用 LF。
# 本项目是纯前端 + Rust，没有任何工具依赖 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源，禁止任何换行转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mov   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary

# 锁文件体积大、diff 噪音高，评审时按生成物对待
pnpm-lock.yaml       -diff linguist-generated
src-tauri/Cargo.lock -diff linguist-generated
